{
 "_note": "实时会话提醒的取数段(doc/ccusage-live-timeline.md §6.1)。取服务端提醒视图 ?view=a:有没有等你授权 ≥perm 分钟的会话、有没有一轮跑了 ≥long 分钟后停下等你的会话,各带一个事件键(同一件事键不变)。判定在 xJob/flow/edge.df。\n⚠️ 只认本轮真取回的数据:没响应抛错 → 宿主判「未知」,不响也不动基准(alert-design §5.2)。",
 "version": 1,
 "actions": [
  {
   "id": "resp",
   "action": "request",
   "params": {
    "url": "https://usage.numable.app/live?view=a&perm=${perm}&long=${long}",
    "method": "GET",
    "header": {
     "User-Agent": "Numable"
    },
    "formatType": "json",
    "credential": "nu"
   }
  },
  {
   "op": "if",
   "props": {
    "val": "$[if::(eq::(${resp},),1,0)]"
   },
   "items": [
    {
     "action": "error",
     "params": {
      "errorMsg": "ccusage_live_unreachable"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "waitKey",
    "value": "${resp.a.waitKey}"
   }
  },
  {
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "wProj",
    "value": "$[if::(startsWith::(findNotEmpty::(${@app.language},zh),en),${resp.a.wProjE},${resp.a.wProjZ})]"
   },
   "_note": "项目名按 App 语言挑好再给通知文案用(没上传项目名时服务端给「项目 A」/「Project A」两份)。G47 要求译文与基准引用同一组变量,所以在这里合成一个 wProj。"
  },
  {
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "wMins",
    "value": "${resp.a.wMins}"
   }
  },
  {
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "doneKey",
    "value": "${resp.a.doneKey}"
   }
  },
  {
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "dProj",
    "value": "$[if::(startsWith::(findNotEmpty::(${@app.language},zh),en),${resp.a.dProjE},${resp.a.dProjZ})]"
   }
  },
  {
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "dMins",
    "value": "${resp.a.dMins}"
   }
  },
  {
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "stuckKey",
    "value": "${resp.a.stuckKey}"
   }
  },
  {
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "sProj",
    "value": "$[if::(startsWith::(findNotEmpty::(${@app.language},zh),en),${resp.a.sProjE},${resp.a.sProjZ})]"
   }
  },
  {
   "op": "set",
   "props": {
    "key": "sWhy",
    "value": "$[if::(startsWith::(findNotEmpty::(${@app.language},zh),en),${resp.a.sWhyE},${resp.a.sWhyZ})]"
   },
   "_note": "卡住的原因(连续失败 / 一轮打转 / 反复压缩 / 久等授权),服务端中英各给一份,这里按语言挑。"
  },
  {
   "action": "resultFilter",
   "params": {
    "keys": [
     "waitKey",
     "wProj",
     "wMins",
     "doneKey",
     "dProj",
     "dMins",
     "stuckKey",
     "sProj",
     "sWhy"
    ]
   }
  }
 ]
}
